  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MATAMBA FILM LAB&apos;S FIRST IMMERSIVE FESTIVAL FOR WOMEN</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a once off contribution of &#x20ac;3,000 to contribute to the running of Matamba Film Lab&#x2019;s first Immersive Film Festival from 18 October to 22 October in Harare which features a number of events showcasing the work of women in tech and virtual reality.  The festival programme includes master classes in virtual reality and film making, industry showcasing and networking events, including a Women World&#x2019;s Showcase bringing together women leaders in virtual reality and animation.</narrative>
  </description>
